\cf0 \
\
We suggest running with Mac OS X version 10.4.11 or newer.\
\
You are about to install or upgrade software which may have several effects on your M-Audio USB devices. The software will: \
\
\'a5 provide the latest audio drivers for the M-Audio Transit USB.\
\
\'a5 provide the latest firmware for the following devices: \
\
        \'a5 Keystation 49 and 61 \
        \'a5 MIDISPORT 1x1, 2x2, 2x4, 4x4, and 8x8 \
        \'a5 MobilePre USB \
        \'a5 Oxygen8 \
        \'a5 Ozone \
        \'a5 Radium \
        \'a5 Sonica \
        \'a5 Transit USB \
        \'a5 Uno \
\
\'a5 upgrade the firmware if necessary on the following devices: \
\
        \'a5 Audiophile USB \
\
If you have installed any of the known third-party drivers for these devices, this installer will remove those drivers to avoid conflicts. \
\
Once you have completed installation, connect the device to a USB port on your computer. (We do not recommend the use of USB hubs with our devices.) \
